            "review_title": "Review at Yen Sushi Sake Pub",
            "review_text": "Relax00728841729\n10 contributions\n0\nOtoro Fat Tuna Belly\nMar 2026 • Solo\nI’m a fan of the tuna belly, but not everywhere in Saigon makes me feel like here. Tuna slices at the Yen branch of Le Loi are sliced quite thickly, clearly showing the marble-clear fat lines. When you put it in your mouth, you feel the fish fat immediately dissolves, leaving a very original and pure grease. While the price isn’t cheap, compared to the freshness and appetite of the dish, it’s quite worth the money for an upscale party.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
