            "review_title": "Review at Yen Sushi Sake Pub",
            "review_text": "Dirk M\nTentlingen101 contributions\n0\nExcellent Sushi, with \"extraordinary\" Dishes\nJul 2025 • Solo\nI had dinner there and it was some of the best sushi that I have ever eaten. Not just the ordinary sushi choice with Nigiri and Sashimi but some very nice choices, e.g. \"tacos\" with Sushi, Sushi on Avocado, etc. (see pictures). \nNot expensive for Sushi (I paid 1.3 mio VND for a huge meal, including drinks).\nService is ok, the atmosphere in the restaurant very nice. \nThis is a chain, I was in the restaurant on 68 Le Loi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 18, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
